# PhotoKiosk Changelog

## [0.0.3] - 2026-11-03

### Added
- **Split-Screen Gallery & Photo Editor Interface**:
  - Replaced multi-screen workflow with a split-screen view: gallery tile grid on the left half, individual photo print editor on the right half.
  - Added density controls (4, 8, 16 thumbnails per row) and a selected images counter on the top bar.
  - Image inspection pane on the right showing live crop previews (*Fill-in*, *Fit-in*, *Border 4mm*, *No-resize*).
  - Horizontal print size cards: `+` button on top, size name, paper type dropdown menu, `-` button on bottom, price per print display, and `✕ Remove` button underneath (disabled if only 1 card remains).
  - `+ Add Size` card button with matching card dimensions, opening a scrollable dropdown of available sizes with a 2000ms inactivity auto-close timer and tap-outside dismissal.
  - Cross-photo format synchronization: adding a print format adds it across all photos in the session with 0 initial count; removing a format removes it only from the active photo.
  - Order selection checkboxes on both gallery tiles and editor pane, automatically selecting photos when print count > 0 and automatically deselecting photos when count reaches 0.
- **Background Staging & Selective Order Storage**:
  - Automatically copies selected photos to temporary session storage (`storage/temp_sessions/session_<id>/`) in the background.
  - Automatically deletes unselected staged files from temporary storage upon proceeding to the order summary, ensuring only selected files are stored and processed.
- **Order Summary Grouping & Pricing**:
  - Direct transition from GalleryScreen to OrderSummaryScreen without intermediate config screen.
  - Grouped breakdown of prints by paper finish and size with individual copy counting, subtotals, and grand order total.
- **Admin Paper Settings & Services JSON Pricing Binding**:
  - Dedicated "Paper Settings & Service Pricing" section in the Admin Settings tab.
  - Management of paper finishes (add new finish, toggle active state, delete).
  - Direct `services.json` upload importer in Admin settings, parsing standard `ODBITK_` items (ignoring slide prints and non-print items) and automatically binding prices into the `print_service_prices` database table.

## [0.0.2] - 2026-11-03

### Added
- **Windows Portable Devices (WPD) iPhone Photo Scanner**:
  - Implemented production recursive iPhone photo discovery and enumeration based on `wp_iphone_scanner_prototype.py`.
  - Windows Shell COM traversal (`Shell.Application` NameSpace 17) confined to dedicated COM worker thread.
  - Multi-extension image and video classification matching prototype formats with case-insensitive matching.
  - Distinct session tracking (`session_id`) and scan attempt tracking (`scan_id`) to prevent duplicate scans and discard stale events.
  - Resilient error handling allowing directory enumeration to continue through restricted folders/files.
- **Touchscreen Kiosk User Interface**:
  - Initial photo source selection prompt ("Where should we look for images?") before initiating scanning.
  - Full-fidelity scanning progress modal overlay showing "Scanning...", real-time found photos count, elapsed time, and current directory.
  - Device authorization guidance banner displayed when zero photos are detected, prompting user to unlock device and trust computer or enable MTP file transfer.
  - Post-scan date range filter dialog offering 1 Month, 3 Months, 6 Months, or All photos with calculated `YYYY-MM-DD - YYYY-MM-DD` date bounds.
  - Automatic transition taking scanned device as source, staging thumbnails in temporary session storage (`storage/temp_sessions/session_<id>/`), and cleaning up temporary folders after order completion.
- **External Removable Device Detection**:
  - Windows removable drive detection using `GetDriveTypeW(DRIVE_REMOVABLE = 2)` to properly detect pendrives mounted as drive letters (e.g., `E:\`).
  - Separation of optical media (`DRIVE_CDROM = 5`) from removable USB storage devices.
- **Admin Panel Enhancements**:
  - Configurable photo source toggles under Settings to enable or disable iPhone/iPad, Android, Removable Media, CD/DVD drives, and Network shared storage in the kiosk UI.
  - Storage & File Manager subfolder browsing with directory breadcrumbs and parent navigation.
  - Download functionality in File Manager allowing single-file downloads or compressed zip downloads for folders with path traversal security.
- **Cross-UI Color Themes**:
  - Predefined cohesive color palettes: `midnight_blue` (default), `emerald_green`, `sunset_amber`, and `graphite_dark`.
  - Admin settings dropdown to change active theme, applying CSS variables dynamically across Web Admin and CustomTkinter Touchscreen GUI.

## [0.0.1] - 2026-11-03
- Initial release: Touchscreen Kiosk UI, FastAPI backend, 300 DPI image processing pipeline, and remote web administration.
